---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Patient Journey & Care Protocol — AUREA Private Institute"
  description="Review the 5-stage patient experience protocol at AUREA: from private consultation to 3D diagnostics, collaborative mockup, precision treatment, and lifelong aftercare."
>
  <section class="py-24 md:py-36 bg-ivory-50 border-b border-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-6">
        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-champagne-600 font-sans font-medium">
          The Care Protocol
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl text-charcoal-900 font-light leading-[1.1]">
          Designed for peace of mind at every step.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-stone-600 font-sans font-light leading-relaxed">
          At AUREA, no treatment is ever rushed. We believe that an exceptional result is built through rigorous diagnostic communication, physical aesthetic previews, and lifelong preventative care.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 Stages Detailed Walkthrough -->
  <section class="py-24 md:py-36 bg-stone-100/40 border-b border-stone-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 space-y-16">
      
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-300 bg-ivory-50 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne-600 font-medium">Stage 01</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">90 Minutes · Private Suite</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
          The Private Diagnostic Dialogue
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 font-light font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Your journey begins in a private consultation lounge. We explore your dental history, personal aesthetic ideals, breathing habits, and daily comfort. We review high-resolution digital photographs of your facial movement, smile line, and lip dynamics.
        </p>
        <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">
          Key deliverables: Comprehensive photographic records, 3D intraoral scans, initial multidisciplinary discussion.
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-300 bg-ivory-50 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne-600 font-medium">Stage 02</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">Digital Workflow · Virtual Twin</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
          3D Volumetric Mapping & Digital Modeling
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 font-light font-sans leading-relaxed">
          We combine your CBCT 3D bone scans with Trios 5 surface impressions and 4K video analysis. Our engineering software constructs a virtual anatomical replica of your maxillofacial structure, simulating tooth positions and surgical trajectories with 0.1mm accuracy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-300 bg-ivory-50 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne-600 font-medium">Stage 03</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">Physical Verification · 3D Test-Drive</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
          The Intraoral Prototype (The Test-Drive)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 font-light font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Before any permanent work begins, we place a reversible composite prototype directly in your mouth. You see, feel, and speak with your future teeth. You evaluate tooth lengths, color harmony, and lip fullness in natural daylight.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-300 bg-ivory-50 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne-600 font-medium">Stage 04</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">Surgical Sanctuary · Micro-Precision</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
          Micro-Precision Execution
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 font-light font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Procedures are carried out under operating microscopes with piezoelectric micro-instruments, preserving up to 95% of healthy natural tooth enamel and bone. For surgical cases, twilight conscious sedation managed by a physician anesthesiologist ensures effortless tranquility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 5 -->
      <div class="p-8 md:p-12 border border-stone-300 bg-ivory-50 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4">
          <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-champagne-600 font-medium">Stage 05</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-stone-500 font-sans">Lifelong Preservation · Dedicated Concierge</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
          Dedicated Longitudinal Maintenance
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-stone-700 font-light font-sans leading-relaxed">
          Every restoration is protected with custom precision night orthotics and biological hygiene protocols. We maintain your permanent 3D diagnostic record in our encrypted institute vault, allowing instant replication should future needs ever arise.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-ivory-50 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 space-y-6">
      <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl text-charcoal-900 font-light">
        Experience the AUREA Protocol
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-stone-600 font-sans font-light">
        Contact our medical concierge to reserve your private diagnostic evaluation at our Da Nang institute.
      </p>
      <div class="pt-2">
        <button
          onclick="window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('open-consultation-modal'))"
          class="px-8 py-4 bg-charcoal-900 text-ivory-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] font-sans hover:bg-champagne-600 transition-colors"
        >
          Begin Private Intake →
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>